<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσείω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσσ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rotate, spin round,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δέ τ᾽ ἔνερθεν ὑποσσείουσιν
			ἱμάντι,</span> of a stake, compared to an auger, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.385
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑποσείοντα κεφαλάς</span>
			(vv. ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήν, -ῆς</span>), perh. a form
			of <i>paralysis agitans,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				159
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sift out,</i>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσήθω.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hold out</i> or <i>throw to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					7.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
